Create brain atlas data sets compatible with the 'ggsegverse' plotting packages. Provides pipelines for building cortical, subcortical, white-matter tract, and cerebellar atlases from 'FreeSurfer' annotation files, 'GIFTI' and 'CIFTI' surface formats, 'neuromaps', cerebellar flatmaps, and volumetric 'NIfTI' images. The atlases it builds are intended for visualising results as general anatomical guidance, not as a source of precision geometry for analysis. Mowinckel & Vidal-Piñeiro (2020) \doi{10.1177/2515245920928009}.
